d70954755c.jpg","likes":108,"dislikes":1,"views":9373,"release_date":"1522972800000","season_number":1,"description":"The romantic comedy follows the everyday life of an extremely tsundere (initially aloof and abrasive, but later kind-hearted) boy named Atsuhiro \"Akkun\" Kagari and his girlfriend Non \"Nontan\" Katagiri. Akkun's behavior is harsh toward Nontan with verbal abuse and neglect, but he actually is head-over-heels for her and habitually acts like a stalker by tailing her or eavesdropping. Nontan is oblivious to Akkun's stalker ways, and thinks his actions are cute.","rating":{"sources":[],"value":0,"age":""},"current_season_id":8618,"content_control":"NORMAL"}}